schemas/        JSON Schema contracts, one per resource
src/{{ package_name }}/
  pages/        one class per page; methods are user actions
  components/   parts shared by several pages
  client/       HTTP client: timeouts, GET retries, redacted logging
  services/     one class per resource; returns models
  models/       pydantic request and response models
  data/         test data tables and builders, shared by both layers
  contract.py   JSON Schema validation
  settings.py   APP_* environment settings, shared by both layers
tests/
  ui/           live browser tests, including the API-to-UI seam
  api/          live tests against the API
  unit/         offline tests: page objects on local HTML, client and services on mocks
  fixtures/     static HTML for the offline tests
